2. The Group operates in one reportable business segment i.e., manufacturing of ‘Steel Tubes, Pipes and Structures’ there are no separate reportable segment pursuant to IND AS-108. &lt;BR&gt; 
 &lt;BR&gt; 
3. During the financial year, the Holding Company has undertaken the Sub-division of equity shares and accordingly the face value has been reduced from Rs. 2/-to Re. 1/-. Board of Directors had decided the Sub-Division/Split of 19,65,40,815 Equity shares of Rs. 2/- each into 39,30,81,630 Equity shares of Re. 1/- each in their meeting held on 3rd October, 2024, which was further approved by the shareholders of the Holding Company in their EGM held on 26th October, 2024. &lt;BR&gt; 
 &lt;BR&gt; 
4. In the wake of sub-division/split of equity shares of the Holding Company, the EPS for the current period and corresponding periods have been stated/restated as per the provisions of IND AS-33 “Earning Per Share”. &lt;BR&gt; 
 &lt;BR&gt; 
5. The Group has carried out exercise of balances confirmation of trade receivable, trade payable, advances given, and other financial and non-financial assets and liabilities and have received confirmations in most of the cases. In few cases, such balances are subject to confirmation/reconciliation and their balances are stated as per books of accounts. Adjustments, if any, will be accounted for on confirmation/reconciliation of the same, which in the opinion of the management will not have a material impact. &lt;BR&gt; 
 &lt;BR&gt; 
6. The figures of the quarter ended 31st March, 2025 and 31st March, 2024 are balancing figures between audited figures for the full financial year and the reviewed year-to-date figures up to the third quarter of the respective financial years. &lt;BR&gt; 
 &lt;BR&gt; 
7. The Group has not discontinued any of its operations during the period under review/ audit. &lt;BR&gt; 
 &lt;BR&gt; 
8. Figures for the previous year/ quarters have been reclassified/ regrouped wherever necessary. &lt;BR&gt; 
 &lt;BR&gt; 
